    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028010/extras/66bc50014ca31edf1e8436ba8a2e2241.avif?t=1752718635\" width=616 height=64 /></span>Remy, a demon lord who neglected her duties and led a life of laziness, faced betrayal from her subordinates. Unable to tolerate her idle behavior any longer, they cast a &quot;Weakening Curse&quot; on her and threw her out of the Demon Castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To lift the &quot;Weakening Curse,&quot; Remy needs to collect four &quot;Stones of Dispel,&quot; each held by one of her subordinates. Determined to break the curse and reclaim the Demon Castle, she embarks on a challenging quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Remy manage to lift the curse and return to her leisurely life once more?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028010/extras/b2b9dc76681d8c6ee5627adb6b969f08.avif?t=1752718635\" width=616 height=64 /></span>This game is an action RPG. Players control Remy, utilizing various skills to fight through monsters and conquer the dungeon-like Demon Castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028010/extras/2c54ad5dbad050d22bb116aa2671f5be.avif?t=1752718635\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action RPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide array of skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable controls</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028010/extras/66bc50014ca31edf1e8436ba8a2e2241.avif?t=1752718635\" width=616 height=64 /></span>Remy, a demon lord who neglected her duties and led a life of laziness, faced betrayal from her subordinates. Unable to tolerate her idle behavior any longer, they cast a &quot;Weakening Curse&quot; on her and threw her out of the Demon Castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To lift the &quot;Weakening Curse,&quot; Remy needs to collect four &quot;Stones of Dispel,&quot; each held by one of her subordinates. Determined to break the curse and reclaim the Demon Castle, she embarks on a challenging quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Remy manage to lift the curse and return to her leisurely life once more?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028010/extras/b2b9dc76681d8c6ee5627adb6b969f08.avif?t=1752718635\" width=616 height=64 /></span>This game is an action RPG. Players control Remy, utilizing various skills to fight through monsters and conquer the dungeon-like Demon Castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028010/extras/2c54ad5dbad050d22bb116aa2671f5be.avif?t=1752718635\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action RPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide array of skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable controls</p></li></ul>",
